        <string>Command Comms uses your location to share your unit position with dispatch while the app is open.</string>
        <key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
        <string>Command Comms uses your location in the background so dispatch can see your unit position even when the app is not in the foreground.</string>
